{"html_text": {"ja449:0.1": "<article id='ja449'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja449:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja449:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja449:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja449:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja449:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja449:3.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:3.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:3.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:3.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja449:4.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:4.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:4.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:4.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja449:5.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:5.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:5.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:5.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja449:6.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:6.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:6.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:6.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja449:7.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:7.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:7.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:7.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja449:8.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:8.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:8.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:8.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja449:9.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:9.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja449:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja449:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja449:11.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja449:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja449:0.2": "Dasakanipāta ", "ja449:0.3": "Catudvāravagga ", "ja449:0.4": "11. Maṭṭhakuṇḍalījātaka ", "ja449:1.1": "“Alaṅkato maṭṭhakuṇḍalī, ", "ja449:1.2": "Māladhārī haricandanussado; ", "ja449:1.3": "Bāhā paggayha kandasi, ", "ja449:1.4": "Vanamajjhe kiṁ dukkhito tuvaṁ”. ", "ja449:2.1": "“Sovaṇṇamayo pabhassaro, ", "ja449:2.2": "Uppanno rathapañjaro mama; ", "ja449:2.3": "Tassa cakkayugaṁ na vindāmi, ", "ja449:2.4": "Tena dukkhena jahāmi jīvitaṁ”. ", "ja449:3.1": "“Sovaṇṇamayaṁ maṇīmayaṁ, ", "ja449:3.2": "Lohamayaṁ atha rūpiyāmayaṁ; ", "ja449:3.3": "Pāvada rathaṁ karissāmi te, ", "ja449:3.4": "Cakkayugaṁ paṭipādayāmi taṁ”. ", "ja449:4.1": "“So māṇavo tassa pāvadi, ", "ja449:4.2": "Candasūriyā ubhayettha bhātaro; ", "ja449:4.3": "Sovaṇṇamayo ratho mama, ", "ja449:4.4": "Tena cakkayugena sobhati”. ", "ja449:5.1": "“Bālo kho tvaṁsi māṇava, ", "ja449:5.2": "Yo tvaṁ patthayase apatthiyaṁ; ", "ja449:5.3": "Maññāmi tuvaṁ marissasi, ", "ja449:5.4": "Na hi tvaṁ lacchasi candasūriye”. ", "ja449:6.1": "“Gamanāgamanampi dissati, ", "ja449:6.2": "Vaṇṇadhātu ubhayettha vīthiyo; ", "ja449:6.3": "Peto pana neva dissati, ", "ja449:6.4": "Ko nu kho kandataṁ bālyataro”. ", "ja449:7.1": "“Saccaṁ kho vadesi māṇava, ", "ja449:7.2": "Ahameva kandataṁ bālyataro; ", "ja449:7.3": "Candaṁ viya dārako rudaṁ, ", "ja449:7.4": "Petaṁ kālakatābhipatthaye. ", "ja449:8.1": "Ādittaṁ vata maṁ santaṁ, ", "ja449:8.2": "ghatasittaṁva pāvakaṁ; ", "ja449:8.3": "Vārinā viya osiñcaṁ, ", "ja449:8.4": "sabbaṁ nibbāpaye daraṁ. ", "ja449:9.1": "Abbahī vata me sallaṁ, ", "ja449:9.2": "yamāsi hadayassitaṁ; ", "ja449:9.3": "Yo me sokaparetassa, ", "ja449:9.4": "puttasokaṁ apānudi. ", "ja449:10.1": "Sohaṁ abbūḷhasallosmi, ", "ja449:10.2": "vītasoko anāvilo; ", "ja449:10.3": "Na socāmi na rodāmi, ", "ja449:10.4": "tava sutvāna māṇavā”ti. ", "ja449:11.1": "Maṭṭhakuṇḍalījātakaṁ ekādasamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja449:0.1": "", "ja449:0.2": "", "ja449:0.3": "", "ja449:0.4": "", "ja449:1.1": "maṭṭhakuṇḍalī → maṭṭakuṇḍalī (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja449:1.2": "Māladhārī → mālābhāri (bj); mālabhārī (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja449:1.3": "", "ja449:1.4": "", "ja449:2.1": "So → atha (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja449:2.2": "", "ja449:2.3": "", "ja449:2.4": "", "ja449:3.1": "", "ja449:3.2": "Lohamayaṁ → Lohitakamayaṁ (vv83:3.2, pv17:3.2) ", "ja449:3.3": "Pāvada rathaṁ karissāmi te → ācikkha me bhaddamāṇava (vv83:3.3, pv17:3.3) | karissāmi → kārayāmi (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja449:3.4": "", "ja449:4.1": "", "ja449:4.2": "Candasūriyā → candimasuriyā (sya1ed, sya2ed); candasuriyā (pts-vp-pli1) | bhātaro → dissare (vv83:4 [Maṭṭhakuṇḍalīvimānavatthu]) ", "ja449:4.3": "", "ja449:4.4": "", "ja449:5.1": "kho → ko nidha (vv83:6 [Maṭṭhakuṇḍalīvimānavatthu]) ", "ja449:5.2": "", "ja449:5.3": "", "ja449:5.4": "", "ja449:6.1": "", "ja449:6.2": "", "ja449:6.3": "", "ja449:6.4": "", "ja449:7.1": "", "ja449:7.2": "", "ja449:7.3": "", "ja449:7.4": "", "ja449:8.1": "", "ja449:8.2": "", "ja449:8.3": "", "ja449:8.4": "", "ja449:9.1": "Abbahī → abbuhi (sya1ed, sya2ed); abbahi (pts-vp-pli1); abbhūḷhaṁ (mr) ", "ja449:9.2": "yamāsi hadayassitaṁ → sokaṁ hadayanissitaṁ (vv83:9 [Maṭṭhakuṇḍalīvimānavatthu]) ", "ja449:9.3": "", "ja449:9.4": "", "ja449:10.1": "", "ja449:10.2": "", "ja449:10.3": "", "ja449:10.4": "", "ja449:11.1": "Maṭṭhakuṇḍalījātakaṁ → maṭṭhakuṇḍalijātakaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed); maṭṭakuṇḍalijātakaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) "}, "reference_text": {"ja449:0.1": "", "ja449:0.2": "", "ja449:0.3": "", "ja449:0.4": "", "ja449:1.1": "bj30.374, csp1ed22.217, csp2ed22.217, ms22J_2033, msdiv115, pt